                "title": "Cimarron Lever with Round Rose",
                "description": "The Cimarron Lever with Round Rose has a classic shape with Traditional Round Rose that really makes it stand out. The lever itself is comfortable in the hand while the #2 rose brings an elegance that really makes it something special. The Cimarron Sandcast Bronze Leverset with #2 Round Rose will fit 1-3/8 inch to 3 inch thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions and comes packaged as an easy to install complete set. Choose from flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes for a look that accents the Early American style that you love.",
